WEBVTT

00:07.100 --> 00:08.800
Tamaki, run!

00:17.980 --> 00:19.140
Tamaki!

00:24.990 --> 00:26.150
Are you all right?

00:26.550 --> 00:27.490
Yeah...

00:29.620 --> 00:30.820
It's futile.

00:31.330 --> 00:33.120
I won't let you escape.

00:38.200 --> 00:40.370
What did you do with Monado?

00:40.370 --> 00:43.240
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:43.240 --> 00:44.930
Aria isn't here.

00:45.210 --> 00:46.300
Quiet!

00:47.240 --> 00:48.870
Tamaki, stay back.

00:49.310 --> 00:53.770
I will protect Monado by any means necessary.

00:54.650 --> 00:55.840
This time...

00:57.420 --> 01:02.760
Fate, gods, in order to defeat you,

01:02.760 --> 01:05.390
I've dedicated everything to my search for power.

01:06.230 --> 01:10.690
To gain power, I would not hesitate even to kill.

01:11.370 --> 01:15.030
This time... This time, without a doubt...

01:15.440 --> 01:19.070
Suffer my fists and die!

02:56.940 --> 03:00.900
The Power

02:56.940 --> 03:00.900
of the

02:56.940 --> 03:00.900
Gods

03:08.150 --> 03:09.240
Drei.

03:10.790 --> 03:12.480
What have you done to Vier?

03:12.890 --> 03:14.390
Don't worry.

03:14.390 --> 03:19.020
I just put her to sleep. I won't harm her.

03:19.630 --> 03:25.030
With the condition that you, Monado, will not interfere with us.

03:26.730 --> 03:28.040
Very well.

03:28.040 --> 03:33.010
Really. To think that the
Monado would be so naïve.

03:33.010 --> 03:35.270
What a happy miscalculation.

03:53.160 --> 03:54.290
Takuma!

03:58.370 --> 03:59.360
Damn it!

04:01.000 --> 04:03.400
My body won't listen to me.

04:03.840 --> 04:06.070
My heart is going numb.

04:08.010 --> 04:10.480
The preparations are made.

04:13.980 --> 04:17.780
This is the power of the gods.

04:25.360 --> 04:26.420
This is...

04:27.400 --> 04:30.850
That's the same surge as when the
Onikirimaru awakened before.

04:32.400 --> 04:34.240
I've got a bad feeling.

04:34.240 --> 04:36.400
Ohmi, is it the Onikirimaru?

04:37.440 --> 04:39.370
We still have one option.

04:39.870 --> 04:41.540
In any case, let's hurry.

04:41.540 --> 04:43.340
We have to get to the Artifacts.

04:48.220 --> 04:50.650
It's just about time, I'd say.

04:51.450 --> 04:56.050
The Onikirimaru has become too strong.

04:59.160 --> 05:01.390
Make yourself at home.

05:13.240 --> 05:14.870
So they've come.

05:18.150 --> 05:19.550
Very well.

05:20.010 --> 05:22.950
You've done well until now.

05:23.950 --> 05:26.250
This is your reward.

05:27.120 --> 05:31.580
Devour their souls to your heart's content.

05:36.700 --> 05:39.170
Look for Aria.

05:39.700 --> 05:42.970
She is the key to obtaining the Artifacts.

05:43.540 --> 05:44.770
That kid?

05:49.710 --> 05:50.940
This way.

06:04.530 --> 06:05.490
You...

06:06.360 --> 06:07.590
Crow.

06:09.460 --> 06:12.230
I will devour your soul.

06:12.830 --> 06:14.340
Everyone go ahead.

06:14.340 --> 06:17.000
Stop joking. I'll stay, too.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.910
Understood. I'm counting on you.

06:18.910 --> 06:21.540
Let's go. Right now, the Artifacts are the priority.

06:22.640 --> 06:25.010
As you wish, I'll be your opponent!

06:25.010 --> 06:27.310
You smell terrible.

06:40.760 --> 06:41.700
Takuma.

06:42.400 --> 06:43.460
Tamaki.

06:44.030 --> 06:45.500
Run.

06:45.500 --> 06:47.940
Right now. Get away!

06:48.470 --> 06:50.540
I don't want to.

06:50.540 --> 06:52.910
You promised you'd be by my side.

06:53.240 --> 06:55.010
Idiot. Just run!

06:56.980 --> 07:00.970
Why? Why does this man's heart...?

07:01.680 --> 07:03.170
The Tamayori's blood!

07:04.790 --> 07:10.660
Are you the one who prevents my complete recovery, Tamayori princess?

07:12.960 --> 07:16.690
That's not Takuma. Who are you?

07:17.060 --> 07:19.100
I am Power.

07:19.100 --> 07:21.400
I've existed from the beginning,

07:21.400 --> 07:24.070
and was named a god.

07:27.140 --> 07:28.700
Onikirimaru.

07:30.480 --> 07:31.500
Takuma!

07:41.360 --> 07:43.720
Takuma...

07:46.760 --> 07:48.200
Takuma...

07:48.730 --> 07:50.460
I'm sorry.

07:51.830 --> 07:52.960
<i>That's right.</i>

07:53.630 --> 07:56.770
<i>Back then, the Tamayori princess sealed...</i>

07:56.770 --> 07:59.400
<i>the Underworld god's power, the power of the Onikirimaru.</i>

08:00.640 --> 08:05.710
<i>How did I, the Tamayori princess, save the Underworld god?</i>

08:07.280 --> 08:11.220
<i>If this goes on, there will be nothing left of Takuma.</i>

08:15.020 --> 08:16.250
<i>I...</i>

08:17.960 --> 08:18.890
<i>I...</i>

08:19.690 --> 08:21.960
I give my all...

08:28.200 --> 08:29.190
<i>My...</i>

08:30.970 --> 08:31.960
<i>all...</i>

08:33.040 --> 08:34.270
<i>to Takuma.</i>

08:36.310 --> 08:40.450
<i>Takuma, you're still there, right?</i>

08:40.450 --> 08:44.580
<i>I have one last request, Takuma.</i>

08:46.450 --> 08:47.180
Tamaki...

09:11.910 --> 09:12.850
<i>Tamaki.</i>

09:17.220 --> 09:18.150
<i>I love you.</i>

09:19.120 --> 09:21.350
<i>I love you, Takuma.</i>

09:22.590 --> 09:25.860
<i>I give my life to you.</i>

09:26.890 --> 09:30.920
<i>Live and be happy.</i>

10:06.130 --> 10:07.290
Takuma...

10:09.640 --> 10:10.940
You're back.

10:11.370 --> 10:15.040
Then the Onikirimaru's power was sealed.

10:15.640 --> 10:18.550
Yes. It feels like...

10:19.750 --> 10:23.740
the Onikirimaru's power has been absorbed within my body.

10:27.290 --> 10:30.320
You're saying that you've become a god,

10:30.320 --> 10:32.990
become fate itself.

10:35.130 --> 10:38.800
He who takes in power and fate,

10:38.800 --> 10:42.130
I will ruin your arrogant face!

10:42.900 --> 10:45.870
I don't know what you mean by gods or fate,

10:45.870 --> 10:48.310
but the Onikirimaru has been sealed.

10:48.940 --> 10:51.280
What's the purpose in fighting me now?

10:51.280 --> 10:52.940
You wouldn't understand!

10:54.020 --> 10:57.220
The misery of those crushed by power, violence, and fate,

10:57.220 --> 10:59.920
all because of their own helplessness.

11:00.690 --> 11:02.160
I will defeat you,

11:02.160 --> 11:03.760
you who have become a god.

11:03.760 --> 11:06.850
I will not be crushed by fate again.

11:07.330 --> 11:11.990
What is the point in obtaining strength that only hurts people?

11:12.470 --> 11:15.960
You're the one who's crushing the weak!

11:16.540 --> 11:23.380
The power that I have built up until now has all been for this moment!

11:37.990 --> 11:39.150
Aria.

11:39.660 --> 11:40.720
Snake,

11:41.460 --> 11:42.990
you're late.

11:43.530 --> 11:45.400
I was tired of waiting.

11:45.400 --> 11:46.370
Stop.

11:47.940 --> 11:49.300
You mustn't kill him.

11:52.040 --> 11:56.740
I won't kill him if it is your command.

11:57.080 --> 11:58.600
However...

12:11.330 --> 12:13.350
Come, Crow.

12:14.060 --> 12:16.960
I've been waiting for this moment.

12:17.260 --> 12:20.720
Enough of your speeches. Come at me!

12:26.710 --> 12:29.140
Don't forget I'm here, too.

12:32.710 --> 12:34.180
I won't let you escape.

12:45.130 --> 12:49.830
Crow. I want to devour your soul,

12:50.300 --> 12:53.560
agonized by your pain and suffering.

12:55.240 --> 12:56.330
You...

13:11.990 --> 13:13.080
Power...

13:13.550 --> 13:16.110
The power that I must destroy.

13:16.820 --> 13:19.520
The power I could not obtain.

13:19.990 --> 13:21.720
Why do you possess it?

13:22.160 --> 13:26.930
I've always despised the power that you've sought.

13:27.430 --> 13:29.800
In the end, you and I are...

13:29.800 --> 13:30.900
That's right.

13:31.410 --> 13:34.140
We will never understand each other.

13:45.520 --> 13:46.580
Takuma!

14:06.670 --> 14:09.440
Grandma, what are you doing here?

14:09.510 --> 14:13.210
You did not come here by coincidence.

14:13.610 --> 14:18.720
I used the gods to induce it.

14:18.720 --> 14:20.690
Just what I'd expect from the predecessor.

14:20.690 --> 14:22.450
Splendid skill.

14:23.320 --> 14:24.830
That's...

14:24.830 --> 14:26.120
Lady Baba.

14:28.960 --> 14:32.020
Don't lay a hand...

14:32.830 --> 14:34.430
on Tamaki.

14:37.670 --> 14:38.640
This is...

14:38.640 --> 14:40.800
I'm having Takuma sleep.

14:41.380 --> 14:44.040
He'll soon become too dangerous.

14:44.040 --> 14:47.710
We cannot carelessly get involved.

14:48.620 --> 14:51.520
Why? The seal is finished.

14:52.220 --> 14:54.790
The Onikirimaru's power has been sealed,

14:54.790 --> 14:56.980
so why are you doing this, Grandma?

14:57.360 --> 14:59.380
What are you saying, Tamaki?

14:59.960 --> 15:04.300
The Onikirimaru's power hasn't been sealed at all.

15:05.400 --> 15:06.660
That can't be...

15:16.980 --> 15:18.450
Where am I?

15:22.880 --> 15:24.080
Grandma!

15:26.790 --> 15:27.760
Where's Takuma?

15:29.620 --> 15:30.780
Grandma, listen.

15:31.190 --> 15:32.930
I had a dream of when

15:32.930 --> 15:36.030
the first Tamayori princess sealed the power away.

15:36.030 --> 15:39.020
I sealed away the sword in the same way.

15:39.770 --> 15:41.260
So why?

15:42.740 --> 15:44.970
Right now, the gods have subsided,

15:44.970 --> 15:48.680
and at first glance it might appear as though peace has returned.

15:48.680 --> 15:49.940
However,

15:50.280 --> 15:53.550
there is no information about how the dangerous

15:53.550 --> 15:59.650
power that has entered Takuma will affect the world.

15:59.650 --> 16:02.220
But Takuma isn't a monster.

16:02.220 --> 16:03.590
He's the Underworld god.

16:03.590 --> 16:07.030
Whether he's the Underworld god or not doesn't matter.

16:09.100 --> 16:15.000
The power inside of Takuma is beyond this world.

16:15.000 --> 16:17.300
You understand that now, don't you?

16:19.770 --> 16:24.480
The sealed power of the gods must not exist in the world of man.

16:24.480 --> 16:27.480
Hence, it is likely that the power inside

16:27.480 --> 16:31.580
of him will begin to change Takuma himself.

16:36.290 --> 16:37.930
So, Tamaki,

16:37.930 --> 16:43.500
you must return that power to the
Onikirimaru once more and seal it.

16:43.500 --> 16:50.130
However, to seal a power that has been awakened once requires compensation.

16:53.040 --> 16:55.040
And that compensation is...

16:55.040 --> 16:57.640
Your life, Tamaki.

16:59.710 --> 17:01.940
Will that save Takuma?

17:08.720 --> 17:12.590
<i>I give my all to Takuma...</i>

17:14.700 --> 17:15.860
I understand.

17:18.900 --> 17:20.370
If it's for Takuma's sake,

17:20.370 --> 17:23.000
I wouldn't think twice about giving my life.

17:25.170 --> 17:27.230
I have seen your resolve.

17:28.210 --> 17:30.970
Tonight we will perform a ceremony.

17:31.880 --> 17:35.440
Tamaki, may you be happy in your next life.

17:52.930 --> 17:54.160
Mitsuru.

17:55.840 --> 18:00.370
I've always felt I needed to apologize to you, Mitsuru.

18:01.440 --> 18:03.380
About the ceremonial offering.

18:05.210 --> 18:11.240
Until now, I didn't know anything, and you bore it all.

18:11.550 --> 18:14.490
I'm sorry that you've suffered,

18:14.490 --> 18:16.860
but I won't run anymore.

18:16.860 --> 18:19.730
I won't let you suffer anymore, Mitsuru.

18:22.800 --> 18:28.670
I'm ready to do what I must do as Tamayori princess.

18:42.580 --> 18:43.680
Takuma...

18:47.620 --> 18:49.750
O-chan, what's wrong?

18:53.230 --> 18:58.600
I'm all right. So don't cry so sadly.

19:03.970 --> 19:05.700
But you know,

19:07.670 --> 19:10.510
I want to see Takuma after all.

19:16.780 --> 19:18.550
O-chan?

19:30.130 --> 19:31.800
You...

19:31.800 --> 19:35.430
Are you sure you shouldn't be by her side?

19:45.310 --> 19:46.440
Takuma?

19:47.310 --> 19:52.120
Am I seeing Takuma through O-chan's eyes?

19:53.590 --> 19:56.960
You seem different than usual.

19:57.560 --> 20:01.430
It's like you're filled with her presence.

20:02.400 --> 20:03.660
Takuma...

20:03.660 --> 20:06.190
I'm here. I'm right here.

20:06.930 --> 20:09.170
Was Tamaki all right?

20:09.900 --> 20:11.930
She wasn't crying again, was she?

20:13.540 --> 20:16.870
All I seem to do is worry about her.

20:17.880 --> 20:22.650
When was it that I stopped seeing her as the Tamayori princess?

20:26.350 --> 20:28.690
She was always apologizing to me.

20:29.320 --> 20:31.560
I'm sorry for making you fight.

20:31.560 --> 20:33.260
I'm sorry I'm powerless.

20:33.260 --> 20:35.530
I'm sorry all I do is make you protect me.

20:36.000 --> 20:38.360
Those should have all been my lines.

20:39.370 --> 20:43.360
Every time you apologized to me, that's what I thought.

20:46.040 --> 20:47.770
I'm sorry, Tamaki,

20:47.770 --> 20:51.400
for making you scared and for failing to protect you.

20:52.610 --> 20:57.020
You always risked your life to stay by my side.

21:02.060 --> 21:05.960
When I'm with you, I feel like I'm with Tamaki.

21:06.730 --> 21:08.360
Takuma.

21:08.900 --> 21:13.600
Takuma, you've never said that to me.

21:14.270 --> 21:18.000
You never tell me anything important.

21:29.980 --> 21:32.150
Goodbye, Takuma.

23:15.190 --> 23:16.520
Well?

23:18.330 --> 23:20.920
Have you made up your mind, Takuma?

23:23.030 --> 23:27.570
If giving my life will bring her happiness,

23:27.570 --> 23:29.000
I will die.

23:34.310 --> 23:38.570
I don't want you to look at other people.

23:39.880 --> 23:43.080
That isn't like me?

23:44.120 --> 23:45.380
That's true.

23:46.850 --> 23:51.690
That's how much I love you.

23:56.130 --> 24:01.030
Next Episode: Scarlet Fragments
